      "writtenOn": "2023-08-31T09:15:10Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "So if I understand correctly, what this snippet attempts to do is: If SCO is connected, ensure there is a CRAS CallInfo like below. If SCO is disconnected, ensure there is no. Actually the phone_ops_enabled value here doesn\u0027t matter.\n```\nCallInfo {\n    index: /* whatever */,\n    dir_incoming: false,\n    source: CallSource::CRAS,\n    state: CallState::Active,\n    number: \"\".into(),\n}\n```\nHow about:\n```suggestion\n                        if self.call_list.iter().all(|c| c.source !\u003d CallSource::CRAS) {\n                            // This triggers a +CIEV command to set the call status for HFP devices.\n                            // It is required for some devices to provide sound.\n                            self.phone_state.num_active +\u003d 1;\n                            self.call_list.push(CallInfo {\n                                index: self.new_call_index(),\n                                dir_incoming: false,\n                                source: CallSource::CRAS,\n                                state: CallState::Active,\n                                number: \"\".into(),\n                            });\n                            self.phone_state_change(\"\".into());\n                        }\n```",
