      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e `num_active` should only be incremented if `phone_ops_enabled` is false\n\nI don\u0027t think so. That means we are sending out mismatched info between CLCC response (based on `self.call_list`) and CIEV command (based on `self.phone_state`). That may confuse the remote BT device which is what we should prevent from.",
