      "message": "OK, but this will change the way the `num_active` is used as for the first call this will set it to 2 calls (one HID and one CRAS when SCO connects).\nCurrently this prevents to hangup the call at least, as only the HID call is removed from `call_list` and then `num_active` is !\u003d 0, which doesn\u0027t trigger the SCO disconnection and so the CRAS entry is not removed from `call_list`.",
